{"schema_version":2,"part":"06_growth_older_play","rules":[{"rule_id":"older.condition_changed","maturity":"experiment_ready","description":"上の子の体調・機嫌にいつもとの差が記録された時だけ表示する","profile_all_tags":["older_child"],"profile_config_equals":{},"when":{"path":"children.older.daily.condition_changed","op":"truthy"},"emit":[{"id":"OLD-DAILY-005","layer":"today","reason":"体調・機嫌のいつもとの差が記録された"}]},{"rule_id":"older.clothing_for_day_open","maturity":"experiment_ready","description":"天候・園予定に対する服装が未確定の時だけ表示する","profile_all_tags":["older_child"],"profile_config_equals":{},"when":{"all":[{"path":"children.older.daily.clothing_for_day_decided","op":"falsy"},{"path":"context.day_active","op":"truthy"}]},"emit":[{"id":"OLD-DAILY-006","layer":"today","reason":"当日の天候・園予定に合う服装が未確定"}]},{"rule_id":"older.clothing_or_shoe_fit_concern","maturity":"experiment_ready","description":"服・靴の具体的なサイズまたは状態の懸念がある時だけ表示する","profile_all_tags":["older_child"],"profile_config_equals":{},"when":{"any":[{"path":"children.older.daily.shoe_fit_concern","op":"truthy"},{"path":"children.older.daily.clothing_fit_or_shortage","op":"truthy"}]},"emit":[{"id":"OLD-DAILY-007","layer":"review","reason":"靴のサイズ・状態に懸念がある"},{"id":"OLD-DAILY-008","layer":"review","reason":"衣類のサイズまたは不足に懸念がある"},{"id":"GROW-003","layer":"review","reason":"上の子の服サイズアウト確認"},{"id":"GROW-004","layer":"review","reason":"靴サイズアウト確認"}]},{"rule_id":"older.sleep_pattern_changed","maturity":"experiment_ready","description":"就寝時刻・睡眠時間の大きな変化が記録された時だけ表示する","profile_all_tags":["older_child"],"profile_config_equals":{},"when":{"path":"children.older.daily.sleep_pattern_changed","op":"truthy"},"emit":[{"id":"OLD-DAILY-011","layer":"review","reason":"睡眠時間・就寝時刻の大きな変化が記録された"}]},{"rule_id":"older.one_to_one_needed","maturity":"experiment_ready","description":"上の子との個別時間が必要と記録された時だけ表示する","profile_all_tags":["older_child","infant"],"profile_config_equals":{},"when":{"any":[{"path":"children.older.daily.one_to_one_time_needed","op":"truthy"},{"path":"children.older.daily.sibl